// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Constant resolution: #define / static const scanned the same way
// parse-source's own constants.js does, but from dxc's dx.source.contents
// debug info (every original, pre-preprocessor source file it embedded -
// already read once for extractLeadingComment()/original-attrs.js, see
// original-attrs.js's header comment) instead of walking the filesystem -
// so a `[MaxRecords(1 * 32 * CUBOID_FACES)]` resolves CUBOID_FACES even
// though parse-dxil never touches the original project tree itself.
//
// Kept as parse-dxil's own copy rather than importing parse-source/
// constants.js, matching this codebase's existing per-parser duplication
// (e.g. NODE_IO_KINDS in dxil-metadata.js) - each parser is meant to stand
// alone. Only the actual resolution algorithm (resolveExpr/
